      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. The key non-obvious behavior is that `ofTaiSeconds(-3113L, -1194L)` normalizes a negative nano-adjustment by borrowing one second, resulting in seconds=-3114 and nanos=999998806. I'll improve the test by adding explanatory comments and using clearer variable names.The improved test compiled successfully."
    }
